<ui:UXML xmlns:ui="UnityEngine.UIElements" xmlns:uie="UnityEditor.UIElements" xsi:schemaLocation="UnityEngine.UIElements ../../UIElementsSchema/UnityEngine.UIElements.xsd" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" editor-extension-mode="False">
    <Style src="project:/Assets/UI/Styles/GlobalStyles.uss" />
    <ui:VisualElement name="overlay" class="overlay">
        <ui:VisualElement name="popup-container" class="card-glow" style="width: 85%; max-width: 580px; align-items: center; background-color: rgba(13, 2, 33, 0.92); padding: 50px;">
            <ui:Label name="logout-title" text="XAC NHAN DANG XUAT" style="font-size: 40px; color: white; -unity-font-style: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; letter-spacing: 1px;" />
            <ui:Label name="message-label" text="Ban co muon dang xuat khoi tai khoan hien tai?" style="font-size: 28px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); -unity-text-align: middle-center; margin-bottom: 36px; white-space: normal;" />
            <ui:Button name="logout-yes-btn" text="DANG XUAT" class="btn btn-danger" style="width: 100%; font-size: 34px; height: 86px; border-radius: 22px; margin-bottom: 16px;" />
            <ui:Button name="logout-no-btn" text="HUY" class="btn btn-cancel" style="width: 100%; font-size: 28px; height: 60px; border-radius: 16px;" />
        </ui:VisualElement>
    </ui:VisualElement>
</ui:UXML>
